              "role": "line_img_annotation",
              "text": "The pattern of bricks on the facade of Dasheng Hutong ↑"
            },
            "text": {
              "paragraphs": [
                {
                  "body": "The layout of the nearly 100 French-style houses in rows, the beige brushed cement on the facade, and the red raw bricks laid on the corners and eaves, it is clear that this \"hutong\" still has Art Deco soul inside. So the inheritance and interpretation of its architectural symbols are used in the brand design to reflect the continuation of the century-old lane culture.",
                  "muted": false
                }
